  },
  {
    q: "How far should my head hang off the bed?",
    a: "Descriptions ask for the head to drop back below the level of the body, with the neck extended — commonly described as about 30° [VERIFY]. How far off the edge your shoulders need to be depends on your build and the bed, which is why some instructions put a pillow under the shoulders instead of hanging off the edge [VERIFY]. Follow what your clinician showed you, especially if you have neck problems.",
  },
